                <title><![CDATA[【SD Live Performances】Madonna concerts LASERDISCS Domesday Tranfers (1985/1993) [480p LD sourced]]]></title>
                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/madonna-concerts-laserdiscs-domesday-tranfers-1985-1993-480p-ld-sourced.292410/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					<b>MADONNA CONCERTS : LASERDISCS DOMESDAY TRANSFERS</b><br>
For those unfamiliar with the Domesday transfers, let's sum it up this way : What sets these transfers apart is their uncompromised quality, surpassing all other available versions anywhere (more info <a href="https://youtu.be/QDlbwl3f39Q?si=632lyQ_-qPqwebwL" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">here</a> and <a href="https://simoninns.github.io/DomesdayDuplicator-docs/Misc/Overview.html" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">here</a>). All credits go to @interlacedgeek for the incredibly generous and remarkable work he did on transferring these Madonna concerts (still not available in digital format) from laserdiscs to digital using the Domesday method. These are the original transfers as posted by @interlacedgeek. These are simply not to be missed.<br>
<br>
<b>THE VIRGIN TOUR live in Detroit 1985</b><br>
Domesday transfer | MKV | 480p | 4.4GB<br>
<br>
<b>WHO'S THAT GIRL? Mitsubishi Special 1987</b><br>
Domesday transfer | MKV | 480p | 11.4GB<br>
<br>
<b>THE BLOND AMBITION TOUR live in Japan 1990</b><br>
Domesday transfer | MKV | 480p | 9.5GB <br>
<br>
<b>THE BLOND AMBITION TOUR live in Nice 1990</b><br>
Domesday transfer | MKV | 480p | 8.4GB <br>
<br>
<b>THE GIRLIE SHOW live Down Under 1993</b><br>
Domesday transfer | MKV | 480p | 10.4GB<br>
<br>
